## What is acceptable

Reading the published site at https://zrosenbauer.com is welcome.

Quoting brief passages with clear attribution and a link back to the
source is acceptable under standard fair-use principles.

Anything beyond that, including copying full posts, images, or designs
into another work, dataset, training corpus, or republished form,
requires written permission.

